Use VdfBase.pkg

Class cKinematicViscosityHandler is a cObject
    Function StokeToSquareCmPerSecond Decimal decStoke Returns Decimal
        Decimal decSquareCmPerSecond
        
        Move (decStoke * 1.0) to decSquareCmPerSecond
        
        Function_Return decSquareCmPerSecond
    End_Function

    Function StokeToSquareInchPerSecond Decimal decStoke Returns Decimal
        Decimal decSquareInchPerSecond
        
        Move (decStoke * 0.155) to decSquareInchPerSecond
        
        Function_Return decSquareInchPerSecond
    End_Function

    Function StokeToSquareFeetPerSecond Decimal decStoke Returns Decimal
        Decimal decSquareFeetPerSecond
        
        Move (decStoke * 0.0010764) to decSquareFeetPerSecond
        
        Function_Return decSquareFeetPerSecond
    End_Function
End_Class